GitHub Hygiene

Review all four projects for:

Unnecessary files
Secrets
API keys
Passwords
Credentials
Private configuration
Private test data

Use:

git ls-files | Select-String -Pattern '\.env$|secret|password|credential|token|key|private|config'

Also manually review important source and configuration files.

